@host = http://localhost:5218

### Opret bruger
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "arrangoer", "password": "hemmelig123" }

### Login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "arrangoer", "password": "hemmelig123" }

### Opret quiz
POST {{host}}/api/quiz
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Firmafest 2026",
  "creatorId": 1,
  "questions": [
    {
      "question": "Hvilken farve har Danmarks flag?",
      "answerOptions": [
        { "answer": "Rød", "isCorrect": true },
        { "answer": "Blå", "isCorrect": false },
        { "answer": "Grøn", "isCorrect": false },
        { "answer": "Gul", "isCorrect": false }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

### Hent quizzer for en bruger
GET {{host}}/api/quiz?creatorId=1

### Hent én quiz
GET {{host}}/api/quiz/1

### Slet quiz
DELETE {{host}}/api/quiz/1

### Start session (opretter rum i lobby)
POST {{host}}/api/quizsession
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quizId": 1 }

### Hent session
GET {{host}}/api/quizsession/123456

### Aktuelt spørgsmål
GET {{host}}/api/quizsession/123456/current-question

### Leaderboard
GET {{host}}/api/quizsession/123456/leaderboard

### Afslut session
POST {{host}}/api/quizsession/123456/end
